{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視（TVB）年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》今晚（19日）舉行，每年台慶都會有豐富獎金、獎品作抽獎，今年甫開首經已送出兩份獎品連免找數簽賬總值8萬3千元，結果羅嘉良抽中黃庭鋒，汪明荃則抽中劉頌鵬，而黃庭鋒被抽中時，一度找不到他，幸最終都趕得切出來講恭賀說話及領奬。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.181674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:20:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:13.032714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:11:01.370431+00:00","content_hash":"19a07e3ebf89d37c1265e5b033de5abaaaf71c0f87dfdb44e978700346aa7403","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.181674+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}